From dd0a052a75956e37a0c84fe345f7dcc9eb61a814 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stephan-xyz <stephan@zehrer.xyz>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:48:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] bcm2835-mboxd: VideoCore mailbox driver for firmware
 properties

Asks the Raspberry Pi firmware over the property mailbox for the SoC
temperature, clock rates, throttling flags and board data, and serves
them as text files in the mbox scheme: temperature, throttled, clocks
and board.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
